		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>I, on behalf of COE take great pride in welcoming you to our campus. We believe in fostering a climate that encourages learning and personal growth. We value a commitment to excellence in all we do. This is the place where you can find the college of your dreamThe aim of education is to teach us how to think, than what to think, to improve our mind, think for ourselves, and not just fill our brains. Education makes a man a right thinker and a correct decision maker. He achieves from the external world, teaching him with past history, so that he may be a better judge of the present. Without education, man, as it were, is locked up in a windowless room. With education, he finds himself in a room with all its windows open to the outside world. Thus, the confidence from the outside world can be achieved very well during the course session in COE</p>

